    "disabled": false,
    "info": "MQTT dashboard for the Smart Greenhouse (Arduino UNO + ESP32-CAM).\n\n- Subscribes to `greenhouse/state` (JSON) and `greenhouse/availability`.\n- Publishes commands to `greenhouse/cmd`.\n\nOpen the dashboard at http://<node-red-host>:1880/dashboard/greenhouse",
